1. Fake Product Review / Spam Email Detection

Fokus: NLP Dasar & Text Cleaning (Regex, Stopwords).

Kenapa: Gerbang masuk sebelum kamu nyentuh BiLSTM nanti.

Algoritma: Naive Bayes / SVM.

2. Predict Employee Attrition (Modif: Student Dropout)

Fokus: Data Tabular & Logika Bisnis.

Kenapa: Belajar fitur apa yang bikin orang "cabut" (Resign/DO).

Algoritma: XGBoost / Random Forest (Feature Importance).

3. Credit Card Fraud Detection

Fokus: Anomaly Detection & Imbalanced Data.

Kenapa: Belajar nanganin data "rusak" (SMOTE, Precision/Recall).

Algoritma: Isolation Forest / Logistic Regression dengan class weights.



